<title>CHINA: China's GOCTIC sets US$40 million loan.</title>
<headline>China's GOCTIC sets US$40 million loan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following syndicated loan issue was announced by arranger Natexis Banque-BFCE.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GUANGDONG OVERSEAS CHINESE TRUST AND INVESTMENT CORP</p>
<p>		(GOCTIC)</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$40 MLN    TYPE	TERM LOAN</p>
<p> MARGIN   3 OR 6ML+30BP  MATURITY  364 DAYS  LAUNCHED  23.JUL.97</p>
<p> DRAWDOWN  ONE LUMP SUM  AVAIL     30 DAYS   REPLIES   13.AUG.97</p>
<p> REPAYMENT  BULLET	 HOME CTRY CHINA     GOV LAW   HONG KONG</p>
<p> MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MANAGERS	US$4-5 MLN   75BP</p>
<p>   SENIOR MANAGERS	 US$2-3 MLN   70BP</p>
<p> ARRANGERS   NATEXIS BANQUE-BFCE (BOOKS, AGENT), ARAB INVESTMENT</p>
<p>		 CO (MIDDLE-EAST BOOKS), DRESDNER BANK'S SHANGHAI</p>
<p>		 BRANCH, KDB ASIA AND STANDARD CHARTERED BANK.</p>
<p> NOTES	 THE ISSUE HAS BEEN FULLY UNDERWRITTEN BY THE</p>
<p>		 ARRANGERS.</p>
<p>		 PROCEEDS WILL BE USED FOR GENERAL FUNDING</p>
<p>		 REQUIREMENTS</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
